@startuml
title MW-08 - Focus Session Execution

start
:Click "Start" on a time slot;

if (A session is already running?) then (Yes)
  :Switch to the running session display;
  :Continue the current session;
else (No)
  :Create the work session;
  :Start the timer;
endif

:Work on the task;

if (End time reached?) then (Yes)
  :Show the overtime warning;
endif

:Click "Stop";
:Select a stop reason and add a note;

:Record the actual elapsed time;

if (Stop reason is "Completed"?) then (Yes)
  :Mark the time slot as completed;
else (No)
  :Return the time slot to the pending state;
endif

if (The session has subtasks?) then (Yes)
  :Confirm which subtasks are done;
  :Update the subtask status;
  if (All subtasks done?) then (Yes)
    :Confirm the parent task is done;
    :Update the task status;
  else (No)
  endif
else (No)
endif

:Move to the next subtask or time slot;

stop
@enduml
